sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant T as TSD Tool Gateway
  participant H as Human/Policy Approval
  participant R as Risk Layer
  participant E as Engine OMS/EMS
  participant U as UI/Audit
  A->>T: propose_target_position
  T->>T: Validate scope, expiry, budget, evidence
  T-->>U: Proposal with rationale and correlation ID
  H->>T: Approve or reject proposal
  T->>R: Re-run risk on approved target
  R-->>T: Decision
  T->>E: Submit approved target only
  E-->>U: Derived orders/fills/positions
  T-->>U: Prompt, evidence, approval, decision, outcome audit chain
